.TH "TODOPRO HUB LIST" "1" "2026-10-13" "1.0.0" "todopro hub list Manual"
.SH NAME
todopro\-hub\-list \- List aggregated external items across...
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B todopro hub list
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List aggregated external items across linked providers (Pro).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-provider\fP TEXT
Filter by provider (e.g. github)
.TP
\fB\-\-state\fP TEXT
Filter by item state (e.g. open, closed)
.TP
\fB\-\-link\fP TEXT
Filter by project link id
.TP
\fB\-\-limit\fP INTEGER
Max items to display  [default: 50]
.TP
\fB\-o,\fP \-\-output TEXT
Output format (pretty, json, yaml)  [default: pretty]
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fP
Output as JSON (alias for --output json)
